# CLPTM — Task Checklist

## Phase 0 — Project Restructure & Cleanup
- [/] Audit all existing files and scripts
- [ ] Create new directory structure (/src, /data/raw, /data/processed, /data/interim, /models, /notebooks, /config, /logs, /evaluation)
- [ ] Archive old scattered scripts into /src/legacy/
- [ ] Move all raw CSVs to /data/raw/
- [ ] Move all processed CSVs to /data/processed/
- [ ] Create config.yaml (paths, league list, min-minutes threshold)
- [ ] Create requirements.txt
- [ ] Create README.md

## Phase 1 — Data Standardization Pipeline
- [ ] Build src/data/ingest.py — loads raw CSVs, validates schema, logs issues
- [ ] Build src/data/standardize.py — aligns columns across leagues, renames to unified schema
- [ ] Build src/data/normalize.py — computes per-90 metrics, league average baselines
- [ ] Build src/data/league_strength.py — computes League Strength Coefficient (LSC)
- [ ] Run pipeline → produce data/processed/unified_dataset.csv
- [ ] Validate output dataset (shape, nulls, dtypes)

## Phase 2 — Feature Engineering
- [ ] Build src/features/engineer.py with:
  - [ ] League-adjusted performance metrics
  - [ ] Team strength ratio
  - [ ] Possession-adjusted stats
  - [ ] Position embeddings
  - [ ] Age curve modeling
  - [ ] Play style vector
- [ ] Run feature engineering → produce data/processed/feature_dataset.csv
- [ ] Log all transformations to logs/feature_engineering.log

## Phase 3 — Modeling
- [ ] Build src/models/train.py with:
  - [ ] XGBoost/LightGBM Gradient Boosting
  - [ ] Neural Network (MLP)
  - [ ] Bayesian Ridge (for uncertainty)
- [ ] Evaluate with MAE, RMSE, calibration curves
- [ ] Build src/models/evaluate.py — backtesting on known transfer cases
- [ ] Save model artifacts to /models/
- [ ] Log evaluation results to /evaluation/

## Phase 4 — Adaptation Modeling
- [ ] Build src/models/adaptation.py — predict performance drop probability
- [ ] Predict adjustment time (in matches)
- [ ] Validate against historical transfer cases

## Phase 5 — Explainability Layer
- [ ] Build src/explainability/shap_analysis.py
- [ ] Build src/explainability/scenario_sim.py
- [ ] Output: top 5 factors driving each projection

## Phase 6 — Inference & Output
- [ ] Build src/predict.py — unified prediction entrypoint
- [ ] Output: goals/90, assists/90, xG/90, minutes expectation, adaptation score, risk score, CI
- [ ] Build src/report.py — human-readable report generation

## Verification
- [ ] Run full pipeline end-to-end
- [ ] Validate known transfer cases (backtest)
- [ ] Write walkthrough.md
